  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 4th level, the guide is constantly under the effects of <em>nondetection</em> as a spell-like ability. She may lower or resume this as a swift action. At 14th level, this additionally functions as per <em>detect scrying</em> and envelops all allies within 30 feet of the guide.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/guide#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
